[{ "action": "append", "id": "event-modals", "value" : "<div tabindex=\"-1\" id=\"modal-95dc972c-d693-4d07-b1bf-4e354f25ee53\" class=\"modal\"><div class=\"modal-dialog modal-lg\"><div class=\"modal-content\"><div class=\"modal-header\"><a data-dismiss=\"modal\" class=\"close\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-remove\"></span></a><p class=\"text-muted\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-road\"></span> Research Track</p><strong>Fri 17 Apr 2026 11:30 - 11:45 at <a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/room/icse-2026/icse-2026-venue-oceania-vii\" class=\"room-link navigate\">Oceania VII</a></strong> - <a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/track/icse-2026/icse-2026-research-track#program\" class=\"navigate\">Dependability and Security 9</a> <small>Chair(s): <a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/icse-2026/jiekeshi2\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\">Jieke Shi</a></small></div><div class=\"modal-body\"><div class=\"bg-primary event-title\"><h4><span data-event-star=\"95dc972c-d693-4d07-b1bf-4e354f25ee53\" title=\"Add event to your program\"><span class=\"text-disabled glyphicon glyphicon-star-empty\"></span></span><strong>Accurate Inference of Termination Conditions</strong></h4></div><div class=\"bg-info event-description\"><span class=\"pull-right\"><span title=\"This paper won an award as a distinguished paper\" class=\"output-badge\"><span class=\"label-primary label\">Distinguished Paper Award</span></span></span><p>We present the first approach to infer accurate termination conditions of programs. It builds on a simple but effective framework where non-terminating states are iteratively identified and removed, and a termination prover is employed to validate the current condition. We instantiate the framework with data-driven provers and design a multi-way data sharing mechanism to enhance their interaction. Our proofs show that this method is correct, accurate, terminating, and relatively complete. Additionally, we introduce generalization techniques for recurrent sets to accelerate the iteration process. Evaluation on a benchmark of programs from the literature shows that our implementation significantly outperforms the state-of-the-art tool Acabar, producing much more accurate termination conditions, with the proposed techniques playing a crucial role in speeding up the convergence of the process.</p>\n<p></p><p></p><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/icse-2026/bitinghuang\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"micro-avatar\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getDefaultImage/micro-avatar?1783985080000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Biting Huang<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">Tsinghua University</span></h5></div></div></a></div><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/icse-2026/zhileihan1\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"micro-avatar\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getDefaultImage/micro-avatar?1783985080000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Zhilei Han<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">Tsinghua University</span></h5></div></div></a></div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/icse-2026/feihe\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"Fei He\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getProfileImage/feihe/eefab96f-4ee0-47a5-ab52-ed5ca08472de/micro-avatar?1783980912000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Fei He<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">Tsinghua University</span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><small>China</small></h5></div></div></a></div></div></div><br></div><div class=\"modal-footer\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/details/icse-2026/icse-2026-research-track/51/Accurate-Inference-of-Termination-Conditions\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default navigate\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-new-window\"></span> All Details</a></span><a href=\"#\" data-dismiss=\"modal\" class=\"btn btn-default\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-remove\"></span> Close</a></div></div></div></div>"},{ "action": "runscript", "value": "$('#modal-95dc972c-d693-4d07-b1bf-4e354f25ee53').modal({ backdrop: 'static', keyboard: true}, 'show');" },
